*> ODEs: a live COBOL right-hand side under every step method, the built-in named systems,
*> a harmonic-oscillator energy check and a Lorenz phase plot.
*> Unlike Lua, COBOL can subclass datamunge::ode::RHS: DECAY-RHS below is its evaluate().
*> CMD: just TARGET=ode_ex run-cobol
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ODE-EX.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY "datamunge.cpy".

*> The decay rate k in dy/dt = -k y, shared with DECAY-RHS.
01 DECAY-RATE   USAGE COMP-2 EXTERNAL.

*> Step methods to compare: name, StepMethod, step size (RK45 also gets 1e-8 tolerances).
01 METHOD-DATA.
   05 FILLER PIC X(28) VALUE "Euler".
   05 FILLER USAGE BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.01.
   05 FILLER PIC X(28) VALUE "Midpoint/RK2".
   05 FILLER USAGE BINARY-LONG VALUE 1.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.01.
   05 FILLER PIC X(28) VALUE "RK4".
   05 FILLER USAGE BINARY-LONG VALUE 2.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.01.
   05 FILLER PIC X(28) VALUE "RK45 adaptive".
   05 FILLER USAGE BINARY-LONG VALUE 3.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.1.
   05 FILLER PIC X(28) VALUE "Adams-Bashforth".
   05 FILLER USAGE BINARY-LONG VALUE 4.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.01.
   05 FILLER PIC X(28) VALUE "Adams-Bashforth-Moulton".
   05 FILLER USAGE BINARY-LONG VALUE 5.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.01.
01 METHODS REDEFINES METHOD-DATA.
   05 METHOD-ENTRY OCCURS 6.
      10 METHOD-NAME PIC X(28).
      10 METHOD-KIND USAGE BINARY-LONG.
      10 METHOD-STEP USAGE COMP-2.

*> The built-in systems: name, parameter count, parameters, state size, initial state.
01 SYSTEM-DATA.
   05 FILLER PIC X(22) VALUE "exponential_decay".
   05 FILLER PIC 9 VALUE 1.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 1.0.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
   05 FILLER PIC 9 VALUE 1.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 1.0.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
   05 FILLER PIC X(22) VALUE "logistic_growth".
   05 FILLER PIC 9 VALUE 2.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 1.0.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 1.0.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
   05 FILLER PIC 9 VALUE 1.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.5.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
   05 FILLER PIC X(22) VALUE "harmonic_oscillator".
   05 FILLER PIC 9 VALUE 1.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 1.0.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
   05 FILLER PIC 9 VALUE 2.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 1.0.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.0.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
   05 FILLER PIC X(22) VALUE "van_der_pol".
   05 FILLER PIC 9 VALUE 1.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 1.0.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
   05 FILLER PIC 9 VALUE 2.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 2.0.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.0.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.
   05 FILLER PIC X(22) VALUE "lorenz".
   05 FILLER PIC 9 VALUE 3.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 10.0.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 28.0.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 2.6666666666666665.
   05 FILLER PIC 9 VALUE 3.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 1.0.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 1.0.
   05 FILLER USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 1.0.
01 SYSTEMS REDEFINES SYSTEM-DATA.
   05 SYSTEM-ENTRY OCCURS 5.
      10 SYSTEM-NAME PIC X(22).
      10 PARAM-COUNT PIC 9.
      10 PARAM-VALUE USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 3.
      10 STATE-COUNT PIC 9.
      10 STATE-VALUE USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 3.

01 RHS          USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 ODE-OPTIONS  USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 SOLVER       USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 SOLUTION     USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 PARAMS       USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 Y0           USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 STATE        USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
*> Plot series, as VECTOR-DOUBLE handles.
01 SERIES-T     USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 SERIES-A     USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 SERIES-B     USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 PLOT         USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
*> Which state components (1-based) COLLECT-SERIES puts into SERIES-A and SERIES-B.
01 COMPONENT-A  USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 COMPONENT-B  USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 FINAL-STATE.
   05 FINAL-VALUE USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 3.
01 STATE-SIZE   USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 POINT-COUNT  USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 I            USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 J            USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 T-END        USAGE COMP-2.
01 EXACT        USAGE COMP-2.
01 X-VALUE      USAGE COMP-2.
01 V-VALUE      USAGE COMP-2.
01 FIXED-TEXT   PIC -(5)9.9(6).
01 FIXED-TEXT-2 PIC -(5)9.9(6).
01 STATE-TEXT   PIC X(120).
01 STATE-POS    USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 STEPS-TEXT   PIC X(6).
01 INT-TEXT     PIC Z(9)9.
01 METHOD-LINE.
   05 ML-NAME   PIC X(28).
   05 ML-Y      PIC 9.999999.
   05 FILLER    PIC X(6) VALUE SPACES.
   05 ML-ERROR  PIC 9.999999.
   05 FILLER    PIC X(6) VALUE SPACES.
   05 ML-STEPS  PIC X(8).
   05 ML-EVALS  PIC X(10).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "=================== dy/dt = -y, y(0) = 1 (live COBOL RHS) ==================="
    MOVE 1.0 TO DECAY-RATE
    SET DM-RHS-EXTEND-EVALUATE TO ENTRY "DECAY-RHS"
    CALL "dm_rhs_extend" USING DM-RHS-EXTEND DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-RHS-EXTEND-RESULT TO RHS
    MOVE 2.0 TO T-END
    COMPUTE EXACT = FUNCTION EXP(- T-END)
    COMPUTE FIXED-TEXT ROUNDED = EXACT
    DISPLAY "exact y(2.0) = " FUNCTION TRIM(FIXED-TEXT)
    DISPLAY "method                      y(2)          abs.error     steps   evals"
    MOVE 1 TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-COUNT
    MOVE 1.0 TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(1)
    CALL "dm_vector_double_from_table" USING DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-SELF TO Y0
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 6
        PERFORM NEW-OPTIONS
        MOVE METHOD-KIND(I) TO DM-ODE-OPTIONS-METHOD-VALUE
        CALL "dm_ode_options_method_set" USING DM-ODE-OPTIONS-METHOD DM-STATUS
        PERFORM CHECK
        MOVE 4 TO DM-ODE-OPTIONS-MULTISTEP-ORDER-VALUE
        CALL "dm_ode_options_multistep_order_set" USING DM-ODE-OPTIONS-MULTISTEP-ORDER DM-STATUS
        PERFORM CHECK
        MOVE METHOD-STEP(I) TO DM-ODE-OPTIONS-STEP-SIZE-VALUE
        CALL "dm_ode_options_step_size_set" USING DM-ODE-OPTIONS-STEP-SIZE DM-STATUS
        PERFORM CHECK
        IF METHOD-KIND(I) = DM-STEP-METHOD-RK45
            MOVE 1.0E-8 TO DM-ODE-OPTIONS-ABS-TOL-VALUE DM-ODE-OPTIONS-REL-TOL-VALUE
            CALL "dm_ode_options_abs_tol_set" USING DM-ODE-OPTIONS-ABS-TOL DM-STATUS
            CALL "dm_ode_options_rel_tol_set" USING DM-ODE-OPTIONS-REL-TOL DM-STATUS
            PERFORM CHECK
        END-IF
        PERFORM NEW-SOLVER
        MOVE SOLVER TO DM-ODE-SOLVER-SOLVE-SELF
        MOVE RHS TO DM-ODE-SOLVER-SOLVE-RHS
        MOVE Y0 TO DM-ODE-SOLVER-SOLVE-Y0
        MOVE 0.0 TO DM-ODE-SOLVER-SOLVE-T-START
        MOVE T-END TO DM-ODE-SOLVER-SOLVE-T-END
        CALL "dm_ode_solver_solve" USING DM-ODE-SOLVER-SOLVE DM-STATUS
        PERFORM CHECK
        MOVE DM-ODE-SOLVER-SOLVE-RESULT TO SOLUTION
        PERFORM READ-FINAL-STATE
        MOVE METHOD-NAME(I) TO ML-NAME
        COMPUTE ML-Y ROUNDED = FINAL-VALUE(1)
        COMPUTE ML-ERROR ROUNDED = FUNCTION ABS(FINAL-VALUE(1) - EXACT)
        MOVE SOLUTION TO DM-ODE-SOLUTION-STEPS-TAKEN-SELF DM-ODE-SOLUTION-FUNCTION-EVALUATIONS-SELF
        CALL "dm_ode_solution_steps_taken_get" USING DM-ODE-SOLUTION-STEPS-TAKEN DM-STATUS
        CALL "dm_ode_solution_function_evaluations_get"
            USING DM-ODE-SOLUTION-FUNCTION-EVALUATIONS DM-STATUS
        MOVE DM-ODE-SOLUTION-STEPS-TAKEN-VALUE TO INT-TEXT
        MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(INT-TEXT) TO ML-STEPS
        MOVE DM-ODE-SOLUTION-FUNCTION-EVALUATIONS-VALUE TO INT-TEXT
        MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(INT-TEXT) TO ML-EVALS
        DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(METHOD-LINE TRAILING)
        PERFORM CLOSE-RUN
    END-PERFORM

    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "=================== Every named built-in system (no override needed) ==================="
    *> Default options.
    MOVE 0 TO DM-ODE-SOLVER-NEW-GIVEN
    CALL "dm_ode_solver_new" USING DM-ODE-SOLVER-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-ODE-SOLVER-NEW-RESULT TO SOLVER
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > 5
        PERFORM SYSTEM-VECTORS
        MOVE 1.0 TO T-END
        PERFORM SOLVE-BUILTIN
        PERFORM READ-FINAL-STATE
        MOVE SPACES TO STATE-TEXT
        MOVE 1 TO STATE-POS
        PERFORM VARYING J FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL J > STATE-SIZE
            IF J > 1
                STRING ", " DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO STATE-TEXT WITH POINTER STATE-POS
            END-IF
            COMPUTE FIXED-TEXT ROUNDED = FINAL-VALUE(J)
            STRING FUNCTION TRIM(FIXED-TEXT) DELIMITED BY SIZE
                INTO STATE-TEXT WITH POINTER STATE-POS
        END-PERFORM
        MOVE SOLUTION TO DM-ODE-SOLUTION-STEPS-TAKEN-SELF
        CALL "dm_ode_solution_steps_taken_get" USING DM-ODE-SOLUTION-STEPS-TAKEN DM-STATUS
        MOVE DM-ODE-SOLUTION-STEPS-TAKEN-VALUE TO INT-TEXT
        MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(INT-TEXT) TO STEPS-TEXT
        DISPLAY SYSTEM-NAME(I) " steps=" STEPS-TEXT " final state=["
            FUNCTION TRIM(STATE-TEXT) "]"
        MOVE SOLUTION TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
        CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
        MOVE PARAMS TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
        CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
        MOVE Y0 TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
        CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE SOLVER TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS

    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "=================== Harmonic oscillator (energy conservation) ==================="
    PERFORM NEW-OPTIONS
    MOVE DM-STEP-METHOD-RK4 TO DM-ODE-OPTIONS-METHOD-VALUE
    CALL "dm_ode_options_method_set" USING DM-ODE-OPTIONS-METHOD DM-STATUS
    MOVE 0.01 TO DM-ODE-OPTIONS-STEP-SIZE-VALUE
    CALL "dm_ode_options_step_size_set" USING DM-ODE-OPTIONS-STEP-SIZE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    PERFORM NEW-SOLVER
    *> Built-in system 3 is harmonic_oscillator, 5 is lorenz.
    MOVE 3 TO I
    PERFORM SYSTEM-VECTORS
    MOVE 20.0 TO T-END
    PERFORM SOLVE-BUILTIN
    PERFORM READ-FINAL-STATE
    MOVE FINAL-VALUE(1) TO X-VALUE
    MOVE FINAL-VALUE(2) TO V-VALUE
    COMPUTE FIXED-TEXT ROUNDED = X-VALUE
    COMPUTE FIXED-TEXT-2 ROUNDED = FUNCTION COS(20)
    DISPLAY "x(20) = " FUNCTION TRIM(FIXED-TEXT) " (cos(20) = " FUNCTION TRIM(FIXED-TEXT-2) ")"
    COMPUTE FIXED-TEXT ROUNDED = X-VALUE * X-VALUE + V-VALUE * V-VALUE
    DISPLAY "energy x^2+v^2 = " FUNCTION TRIM(FIXED-TEXT) " (should stay near 1.0)"

    MOVE 1 TO COMPONENT-A
    MOVE 2 TO COMPONENT-B
    PERFORM COLLECT-SERIES
    MOVE SERIES-T TO DM-R-PLOT-PLOT-X
    MOVE SERIES-A TO DM-R-PLOT-PLOT-Y
    MOVE "x(t)" TO DM-R-PLOT-PLOT-LABEL
    PERFORM LINE-PLOT
    MOVE PLOT TO DM-R-PLOT-LINES-SELF
    MOVE SERIES-T TO DM-R-PLOT-LINES-X
    MOVE SERIES-B TO DM-R-PLOT-LINES-Y
    MOVE "v(t)" TO DM-R-PLOT-LINES-LABEL
    CALL "dm_r_plot_lines" USING DM-R-PLOT-LINES DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-R-PLOT-LINES-RESULT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE "Harmonic Oscillator" TO DM-R-PLOT-TITLE-VALUE
    MOVE "t" TO DM-R-PLOT-X-LABEL-VALUE
    MOVE "state" TO DM-R-PLOT-Y-LABEL-VALUE
    MOVE "ode_harmonic_oscillator_cobol.svg" TO DM-PLOT-SAVE-SVG-PATH
    PERFORM LABEL-AND-SAVE
    DISPLAY "wrote ode_harmonic_oscillator_cobol.svg"
    PERFORM CLOSE-RUN

    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "=================== Lorenz attractor (phase plane) ==================="
    PERFORM NEW-OPTIONS
    MOVE DM-STEP-METHOD-RK4 TO DM-ODE-OPTIONS-METHOD-VALUE
    CALL "dm_ode_options_method_set" USING DM-ODE-OPTIONS-METHOD DM-STATUS
    MOVE 0.005 TO DM-ODE-OPTIONS-STEP-SIZE-VALUE
    CALL "dm_ode_options_step_size_set" USING DM-ODE-OPTIONS-STEP-SIZE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    PERFORM NEW-SOLVER
    MOVE 5 TO I
    PERFORM SYSTEM-VECTORS
    MOVE 25.0 TO T-END
    PERFORM SOLVE-BUILTIN
    MOVE SOLUTION TO DM-ODE-SOLUTION-STEPS-TAKEN-SELF
    CALL "dm_ode_solution_steps_taken_get" USING DM-ODE-SOLUTION-STEPS-TAKEN DM-STATUS
    MOVE DM-ODE-SOLUTION-STEPS-TAKEN-VALUE TO INT-TEXT
    DISPLAY "steps_taken = " FUNCTION TRIM(INT-TEXT)

    MOVE 1 TO COMPONENT-A
    MOVE 3 TO COMPONENT-B
    PERFORM COLLECT-SERIES
    MOVE SERIES-A TO DM-R-PLOT-PLOT-X
    MOVE SERIES-B TO DM-R-PLOT-PLOT-Y
    MOVE "trajectory" TO DM-R-PLOT-PLOT-LABEL
    PERFORM LINE-PLOT
    MOVE "Lorenz Attractor (x-z phase plane)" TO DM-R-PLOT-TITLE-VALUE
    MOVE "x" TO DM-R-PLOT-X-LABEL-VALUE
    MOVE "z" TO DM-R-PLOT-Y-LABEL-VALUE
    MOVE "ode_lorenz_phase_plane_cobol.svg" TO DM-PLOT-SAVE-SVG-PATH
    PERFORM LABEL-AND-SAVE
    DISPLAY "wrote ode_lorenz_phase_plane_cobol.svg"
    PERFORM CLOSE-RUN
    STOP RUN.

*> Sets ODE-OPTIONS to new default ODEOptions and points the option records at it.
NEW-OPTIONS.
    CALL "dm_ode_options_new" USING DM-ODE-OPTIONS-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-ODE-OPTIONS-NEW-RESULT TO ODE-OPTIONS
    MOVE ODE-OPTIONS TO DM-ODE-OPTIONS-METHOD-SELF DM-ODE-OPTIONS-MULTISTEP-ORDER-SELF
        DM-ODE-OPTIONS-STEP-SIZE-SELF DM-ODE-OPTIONS-ABS-TOL-SELF DM-ODE-OPTIONS-REL-TOL-SELF.

*> Sets SOLVER to a new ODESolver with ODE-OPTIONS.
NEW-SOLVER.
    MOVE 1 TO DM-ODE-SOLVER-NEW-GIVEN
    MOVE ODE-OPTIONS TO DM-ODE-SOLVER-NEW-OPTIONS
    CALL "dm_ode_solver_new" USING DM-ODE-SOLVER-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-ODE-SOLVER-NEW-RESULT TO SOLVER.

*> Sets PARAMS and Y0 (and the system name) from built-in system I.
SYSTEM-VECTORS.
    MOVE SYSTEM-NAME(I) TO DM-ODE-SOLVER-SOLVE-BUILTIN-SYSTEM
    MOVE PARAM-COUNT(I) TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-COUNT
    PERFORM VARYING J FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL J > PARAM-COUNT(I)
        MOVE PARAM-VALUE(I, J) TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(J)
    END-PERFORM
    CALL "dm_vector_double_from_table" USING DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-SELF TO PARAMS
    MOVE STATE-COUNT(I) TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-COUNT
    PERFORM VARYING J FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL J > STATE-COUNT(I)
        MOVE STATE-VALUE(I, J) TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(J)
    END-PERFORM
    CALL "dm_vector_double_from_table" USING DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-SELF TO Y0.

*> Sets SOLUTION to SOLVER's solution of the named system from t = 0 to T-END.
SOLVE-BUILTIN.
    MOVE SOLVER TO DM-ODE-SOLVER-SOLVE-BUILTIN-SELF
    MOVE PARAMS TO DM-ODE-SOLVER-SOLVE-BUILTIN-PARAMS
    MOVE Y0 TO DM-ODE-SOLVER-SOLVE-BUILTIN-Y0
    MOVE 0.0 TO DM-ODE-SOLVER-SOLVE-BUILTIN-T-START
    MOVE T-END TO DM-ODE-SOLVER-SOLVE-BUILTIN-T-END
    CALL "dm_ode_solver_solve_builtin" USING DM-ODE-SOLVER-SOLVE-BUILTIN DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-ODE-SOLVER-SOLVE-BUILTIN-RESULT TO SOLUTION.

*> Copies the last state of SOLUTION into FINAL-VALUE and its length into STATE-SIZE.
READ-FINAL-STATE.
    MOVE SOLUTION TO DM-ODE-SOLUTION-SIZE-SELF
    CALL "dm_ode_solution_size" USING DM-ODE-SOLUTION-SIZE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE SOLUTION TO DM-ODE-SOLUTION-STATE-AT-SELF
    COMPUTE DM-ODE-SOLUTION-STATE-AT-INDEX = DM-ODE-SOLUTION-SIZE-RESULT - 1
    CALL "dm_ode_solution_state_at" USING DM-ODE-SOLUTION-STATE-AT DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-ODE-SOLUTION-STATE-AT-RESULT TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-SELF
    MOVE 1 TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-START
    CALL "dm_vector_double_to_table" USING DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-COUNT TO STATE-SIZE
    PERFORM VARYING J FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL J > STATE-SIZE
        MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(J) TO FINAL-VALUE(J)
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-SELF TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS.

*> Fills SERIES-T with SOLUTION's times, SERIES-A and SERIES-B with state components
*> COMPONENT-A and COMPONENT-B (more than 1000 points, so they are pushed one by one).
COLLECT-SERIES.
    MOVE SOLUTION TO DM-ODE-SOLUTION-SIZE-SELF DM-ODE-SOLUTION-TIME-AT-SELF
        DM-ODE-SOLUTION-STATE-AT-SELF
    CALL "dm_ode_solution_size" USING DM-ODE-SOLUTION-SIZE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-ODE-SOLUTION-SIZE-RESULT TO POINT-COUNT
    CALL "dm_vector_double_new" USING DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-SELF TO SERIES-T
    CALL "dm_vector_double_new" USING DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-SELF TO SERIES-A
    CALL "dm_vector_double_new" USING DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-SELF TO SERIES-B
    PERFORM VARYING J FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL J >= POINT-COUNT
        MOVE J TO DM-ODE-SOLUTION-TIME-AT-INDEX DM-ODE-SOLUTION-STATE-AT-INDEX
        CALL "dm_ode_solution_time_at" USING DM-ODE-SOLUTION-TIME-AT DM-STATUS
        PERFORM CHECK
        MOVE SERIES-T TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-SELF
        MOVE DM-ODE-SOLUTION-TIME-AT-RESULT TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-VALUE
        CALL "dm_vector_double_push" USING DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE DM-STATUS
        CALL "dm_ode_solution_state_at" USING DM-ODE-SOLUTION-STATE-AT DM-STATUS
        PERFORM CHECK
        MOVE DM-ODE-SOLUTION-STATE-AT-RESULT TO STATE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-SELF
        MOVE COMPONENT-A TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-INDEX
        CALL "dm_vector_double_get" USING DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE DM-STATUS
        MOVE SERIES-A TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-SELF
        CALL "dm_vector_double_push" USING DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE DM-STATUS
        MOVE STATE TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-SELF
        MOVE COMPONENT-B TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-INDEX
        CALL "dm_vector_double_get" USING DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE DM-STATUS
        MOVE SERIES-B TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-SELF
        CALL "dm_vector_double_push" USING DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE DM-STATUS
        PERFORM CHECK
        MOVE STATE TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
        CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    END-PERFORM.

*> Sets PLOT to a line plot (type "l") of the DM-R-PLOT-PLOT x/y/label.
LINE-PLOT.
    MOVE 4 TO DM-R-PLOT-PLOT-GIVEN
    MOVE "l" TO DM-R-PLOT-PLOT-TYPE
    CALL "dm_r_plot_plot" USING DM-R-PLOT-PLOT DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-R-PLOT-PLOT-RESULT TO PLOT.

*> Sets PLOT's title and axis labels, saves it to DM-PLOT-SAVE-SVG-PATH and closes it.
LABEL-AND-SAVE.
    MOVE PLOT TO DM-R-PLOT-TITLE-SELF DM-R-PLOT-X-LABEL-SELF DM-R-PLOT-Y-LABEL-SELF
        DM-PLOT-SAVE-SVG-SELF
    CALL "dm_r_plot_title" USING DM-R-PLOT-TITLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-R-PLOT-TITLE-RESULT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    CALL "dm_r_plot_x_label" USING DM-R-PLOT-X-LABEL DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-R-PLOT-X-LABEL-RESULT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    CALL "dm_r_plot_y_label" USING DM-R-PLOT-Y-LABEL DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-R-PLOT-Y-LABEL-RESULT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    CALL "dm_plot_save_svg" USING DM-PLOT-SAVE-SVG DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE PLOT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE SERIES-T TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE SERIES-A TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE SERIES-B TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS.

*> Closes SOLUTION, SOLVER and ODE-OPTIONS.
CLOSE-RUN.
    MOVE SOLUTION TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE SOLVER TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE ODE-OPTIONS TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS.

*> Stops with the error after a failed call.
CHECK.
    IF NOT DM-STATUS-OK
        DISPLAY "datamunge error (" FUNCTION TRIM(DM-STATUS-KIND) "): "
            DM-STATUS-MESSAGE(1:DM-STATUS-LENGTH) UPON SYSERR
        STOP RUN RETURNING 1
    END-IF.
END PROGRAM ODE-EX.

*> RHS::evaluate override for dy/dt = -k y: returns a new one-element vector.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. DECAY-RHS.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY "datamunge.cpy".
01 DECAY-RATE   USAGE COMP-2 EXTERNAL.
LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY "datamunge-callbacks.cpy".
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING DM-RHS-EVALUATE-ARGS DM-CALLBACK-STATUS.
    *> y is a borrowed VECTOR-DOUBLE handle; read y[1].
    MOVE DM-RHS-EVALUATE-ARGS-Y TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-SELF
    MOVE 1 TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-INDEX
    CALL "dm_vector_double_get" USING DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE DM-STATUS
    COMPUTE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-VALUE = - DECAY-RATE * DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-VALUE
    CALL "dm_vector_double_new" USING DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE DM-STATUS
    CALL "dm_vector_double_push" USING DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE DM-STATUS
    IF NOT DM-STATUS-OK
        SET DM-CALLBACK-STATUS-CALLBACK TO TRUE
        MOVE DM-STATUS-MESSAGE TO DM-CALLBACK-STATUS-MESSAGE
        MOVE DM-STATUS-LENGTH TO DM-CALLBACK-STATUS-LENGTH
    END-IF
    *> C++ takes the result vector and closes its handle.
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-SELF TO DM-RHS-EVALUATE-ARGS-RESULT
    GOBACK.
END PROGRAM DECAY-RHS.
